=== task: predict hard
title: Calls, end to end
code:
```python
log = []

def count_ways(nums, target):
    log.append(len(nums))
    if len(nums) == 0:
        return 1 if target == 0 else 0
    return count_ways(nums[1:], target - nums[0]) + count_ways(nums[1:], target)

print(count_ways([1, 2, 3], 3), len(log))
```
